cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Roz, please cite it as below."
title: "Roz: A Simulated Terminal Environment for Logic Gates"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Roz is a terminal-based logic gate simulator for Windows and Linux. It
  supports AND, OR, NOT, NAND, NOR, XOR and XNOR gates, nested expressions and
  a LOG command, so that students and hobbyists can learn how logic gates work.
authors:
  - alias: "Thirtexe"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Thirtexe/Roz"
url: "https://github.com/Thirtexe/Roz"
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
keywords:
  - logic gates
  - logic gate simulator
  - digital logic
  - terminal
  - education
